thoughtrecipe blackboard_rearm
"A when-gated source re-arms after its predicate transitions false to true."

agent board uses blackboard

run board:
  source probe:
    when state.gate is ready
    write state.probe_out
    do relurpic:conformance_probe

  source flip:
    when state.gate is missing
    write state.flip_out
    do relurpic:conformance_flip

  source break:
    write state.break_out
    do relurpic:conformance_break
